==Notable Features==
* The [[Cake Scientist]] (needed for unlocking the [[Raids|Dough Raid]]) is located in the largest building at [[Sea of Treats#Cake Land|Cake Land]], in the left room.
* The [[Sick Scientist]] (needed for unlocking the [[Raids|Phoenix Raid]]) is located near the [[Cookie Crafter]]s and behind the largest building at [[Cake Land]] facing towards the [[Water]].
* [[drip_mama]] will give the player a quest to kill 500 enemies on Cake Land to spawn [[Cake Prince]], after talking to drip_mama about your quest completion, the npc will spawn in the [[Dimensional Shift]]. If a player has the [[Sweet Chalice]] which can be crafted with a [[God's Chalice]] and 10 [[Conjured Cocoa]]s, [[Dough King]] can be spawned with the [[Sweet Chalice]].

