==Chest Locations==
* Three Diamond Chests can be found in the Sea of Treats:
** Inside one of the [[trees]] that resemble a stone in [[#Peanut Land|Peanut Land]].
** On top of a building next to [[Cake Queen]]'s castle on [[Ice Cream Land]].
** On top of a building surrounded by [[Cake Guard]]s on [[Sea of Treats#Cake Land|Cake Land]]

==Tips/Notes==
* If used correctly, Chocolate Island can be considered one of the '''best islands for mastery farming'''. Players can start by grinding from the [[Sweet Thief]]s, then moving on to the [[Candy Rebel]]s then back to grinding the three [[Cocoa Warrior]]s standing in a circle. Repeating this cycle helps players increase mastery fast.
** Alternatively, if the player has V4 ([[Cyborg]] or [[Draco]] recommended) and [[Buddha]], they can start with the [[Cocoa Warrior]]s, then move on to the [[Chocolate Bar Battler]]s, followed by the [[Sweet Thief|Sweet Thieve]]s, and finally [[Candy Rebel]]s—then repeat. This is considered the fastest method to gain mastery quickly.
* The best island to farm on for the '''Christmas Update''' is the [[North Pole]], because the entire island has a [[Safe Zone|safe zone]], meaning that nobody can attack the player, except if they're in combat.
* It is recommended to get out of the Sea of Treats as soon as possible as this is the place most exploiters will be farming. (Other places where the player can find a lot of exploiters are the [[Forgotten Island]] and the [[Haunted Castle]])
** Due to the large number of exploiters, the Sea of Treats is also one of the best places to kill them and get free [[Bounty and Honor System|Bounty/Honor]].
** If the player is tired of farming at the Sea of Treats because of exploiters, they can purchase or join a [[Private Servers|private server]].

==Trivia==
* The Candy Cane Land also appears in all seas during [[Christmas Event]]s under the name of [[North Pole]].
** Weirdly, it is still called that now even if it is not Christmas.
* Despite the size of the Sea of Treats, there is only one boss that naturally spawns, which is the [[Cake Queen]].
* The Sea of Treats leveling-up range is extremely lengthy (375 [[levels]]), which makes the Sea of Treats have the largest [[Levels|level]] range in the entire game. (Lv. 2075-2450)

